title: Aether
message: If you use this compiler in academic work, cite this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Aether Contributors
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
abstract: >
  Aether is a small statically typed imperative language with a complete
  compiler pipeline, a register virtual machine, a textual LLVM backend,
  and an in-tree fuzzer.
keywords:
  - compiler
  - virtual machine
  - optimizer
  - fuzzing
